        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: சிந்தி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிந்தி — cinti — \"to think deeply; to reflect\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "முடிவு செய்வதற்கு முன் அவள் நன்றாகச் சிந்தித்தாள். muṭivu ceyvataṟku muṉ avaḷ naṉṟākac cintittāḷ. She thought it over carefully before deciding."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): சிந்தித்தேன், cintittēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What you think about takes -ஐப் பற்றி: அதைப் பற்றிச் சிந்தி (cinti). The noun is சிந்தனை, a thought."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிந்தி (cinti) is a verb built on Sanskrit cintā, \"thought, care\" (CDIAL 4816), with the loan-verb ending -இ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
