              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "muṭivu ceyvataṟku muṉ avaḷ naṉṟākac cintittāḷ. — She thought it over carefully before deciding.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *muṭivu ceyvataṟku muṉ avaḷ naṉṟākac cintittāḷ.* — She thought it over carefully before deciding.]"
